#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Added onsite/alpha regularization. You can specify `regularization_type` to "
"be `onsite` or `alpha`\n"
msgstr ""
"Dodano regularyzację onsite/alpha. Możesz określić `regularization_type` "
